{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4211223fd1c2317e4ae8949606f455c298d7da4f04035fd1fd1a2e4aad7bb25c", "ja": "（PVのリハーサルが終わり、貴音と一緒に\n帰っている。すっかり遅くなってしまったな……）", "zh": "（PV排练结束后，正和贵音一起回去。没想到已经这么晚了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "9dc6338be29f9379f3453feb50b889be97873a816e1a525f396d007f59a6f048", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。……今日は遅くまで\nありがとうございました。こちらで、失礼いたします。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。……今天这么晚了，\n真是非常感谢您。我在此便先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3fd48a07d553e6a61ba1cb86b4d92158c91d4fd3dd2d295687fd7a3d885309a8", "ja": "あっ、待ってくれ。\n夜も遅いし、家まで送っていくよ。", "zh": "啊，等一下。\n都这么晚了，我送你回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "94080cf05e02fef2d48de743c8c7c18b70f9862978a8194718fa9f4e40cbac35", "ja": "えっ……。い、いえ、心配には及びません。\n私は一人でも大丈夫です。……慣れて、おりますから。", "zh": "咦……不、不用了，您不用担心。\n我一个人也没问题……因为，我已经习惯了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9aa3d2ed490f25f694456cf9c95365f7e60d28386dc2850fbe35010554249635", "ja": "（うん……？　貴音にしては、どうも歯切れが悪いな。\nそれに少し元気がないような……？）", "zh": "（嗯……？以贵音来说，总觉得说话有些吞吞吐吐的。\n而且，好像也没什么精神……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "f8baca08353f1dcb2719bccc9cd66554debd219ad8ab33ba16340231bc6e8bc9", "ja": "お気遣い感謝いたします、{$P$}。\nでは、私はこちらで……。", "zh": "感谢您的关心，{$P$}。那么，我就在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1006_p", "source_sha256": "725d9303d474522b8e65f07369cbc30f75fd7ec1a2a9361c603d0d7139e64b49", "ja": "貴音。お腹空いてないか？", "zh": "贵音，你肚子饿不饿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1008_p", "source_sha256": "da8f3d2d2fff617e550eddbde3fcb4b9b5bce3282f006dd05873ecf49b5525d6", "ja": "リハが押して、食事どころじゃなかったろう？　だから\nお腹が空いてるんじゃないかと思ったんだが……。", "zh": "彩排拖延了，连吃饭都顾不上吧？所以我就想着……你是不是饿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "2b3bf02bde58c1175fbb6aa5c867bb0537b87694f23963adda5c7cbe792e471f", "ja": "そう、ですね……。ええ、たしかに。\n今のお話を聞いて、空腹だったことを思い出しました。", "zh": "是啊……嗯，确实如此。听您这么一说，我才想起来自己原来是饿着肚子的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0f44edd95e3c9347d0629ccbd4355f2bed7722842e46d08046f6aa1535ba4890", "ja": "そうか。貴音さえよければ、夕食でもどうだ？\n明日は撮影の本番だし、景気づけも兼ねて！", "zh": "这样啊。只要贵音愿意，要不要一起吃个晚饭？\n明天就是拍摄正式开始的日子，也正好借此打打气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "ee5121ce65a162034f92760a5df13c99ffe4704aec180b244398b64e97197ff9", "ja": "……わかりました。それではお言葉に甘えて\nご一緒させていただきます。", "zh": "……我明白了。那么我就恭敬不如从命，\n与您一同前去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "95f107cea78ef1f25ac4bfcece57e96c684cd9bc80ecb6d562676d642ad061db", "ja": "空腹は最大の調味料と申します。今なら、\n如何なる料理も受け入れられそうです。ふふっ。", "zh": "都说饥饿是最好的调味料。现在的话，\n感觉无论什么料理都能接受呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c5f044861145c491dc96f8e74ef654c563ee6ea883d726f72b3ef330c8668309", "ja": "（食事の間も、特に気になる様子はみられなかった。\nこの調子なら、明日の撮影も大丈夫そうだな！）", "zh": "（用餐期间也没发现什么特别令人担心的情况。照这个状态来看，明天的拍摄应该也没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1014_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1015_kantoku", "source_sha256": "5f94ebe0011dbc18d64549b8972e23bf02f1e451e36c4197092fc03bb51ab302", "ja": "おお……っ！\n四条さん、OKです！　バッチリです！！", "zh": "哦哦……！\n四条小姐，OK！完美无误！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1016_p", "source_sha256": "508043d4268c6b161aaf74be9487e8f875ea8be970d5747d562357688e0dd03d", "ja": "（PV撮影がはじまったが、今のところ順調だ。\n昨夜は心配だったが、貴音も調子がいいみたいだな！）", "zh": "（PV拍摄开始了，目前进展得很顺利。\n虽然昨晚还很担心，但贵音的状态好像也很不错啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "390bca5a6c6c149956fc3c1b4c82ebdcac16f9355c04ca26060a7419505a4c22", "ja": "ふぅ……。お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nここまでの出来はいかがでしたか？", "zh": "呼……辛苦了，{$P$}。\n到目前为止的表现，您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e7b72f6e67070c0692aa98f93f74240fadb9e08916c12ead4f58ceb75d8c6422", "ja": "お疲れ様。とてもよかったよ！　切なさがひしひしと\n伝わってきて……思わず見入ってしまったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。非常棒！那份伤感真切地传达了过来……让我不由得看入了迷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "bc1d96051bf4d326dcff02ef626d8b2542cfc66a54c33c8ad14987ff34856d35", "ja": "ふふ、良かったです。\n昨夜は……思いもよらない幸運に恵まれました。", "zh": "呵呵，太好了。\n昨晚……我遇到了意想不到的幸运。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "f0bb7b9026dbd533917e20d50072eff3f550d402c1eddc4f4f7e2a471cd485f9", "ja": "充分、英気を養いましたし、\nそれ相応の結果でお返ししなければと……。", "zh": "我已经充分养精蓄锐了，所以……一定要用相应的成果来回报才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6d386ef1749158f6df022fe5aa47c3bc8c8560135645db593c6e7a56dabb7b67", "ja": "はは、あれくらいお安い御用だよ。\n貴音の力になれるなら、いつだってご馳走するよ！", "zh": "哈哈，这点小事不在话下。  \n只要能帮到贵音，随时请你吃饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "bacf3b06ef38895c7e5dc562e376d6bace5451f96097fe9990230f6a79123f27", "ja": "まあ……さすが{$P$}。\n実は、来週も大きな撮影が控えておりまして……。", "zh": "嗯……不愧是{$P$}。\n其实，下周还有重要的拍摄在等着我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "623c4abc422d301f0b753ce6310bba11584215bd27c08c6b4f8e54c416e578f9", "ja": "大役に挑むためにも、英気を養わねばと。\n『景気づけ』……期待してもよろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "为了挑战重任，我也必须养精蓄锐才行。\n这份“助兴礼”……我可以有所期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8b9fda4c5bfc971f9312d3023550b8f236a42f658d2d9e32456da460ac94b3bc", "ja": "えっ！？　あ、ああ……任せてくれ！", "zh": "咦！？啊、啊啊……交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a6625c2ed7464b9172a6c00749f8564cbb9b1939341ffb791114a701e9859ae", "ja": "ふふっ、頼もしいお言葉です。\n素敵なえすこーとを期待していますね、あなた様♪", "zh": "呵呵，真是令人安心的话呢。期待您精彩的陪同哦，您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0334_1026_p", "source_sha256": "07ebbc4eceb35fc90a0be5a477f2f6dfcbe08b2f59dece83d668db05363aebf5", "ja": "（その後も撮影はスムーズに進み……無事終了した。\n来週までに、景気づけ……財布が更に軽くなりそうだ）", "zh": "（之后拍摄也顺利进行……平安结束了。\n在下周之前先鼓舞一下士气……钱包看来又要变轻了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
